  "name": "Borrowed Time",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/time/hourglass-yellow-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p><em>Time moves around you rather than through you. Where others must choose between the strike and the step, you take both and find a moment left over, and no one, least of all you, can say where that moment came from.</em></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>1st Level</strong></p><ul><li>You are Quickened. Use the extra action however you like.</li><li>Immune to Slowed, which does not negate your Quickened condition, and immune to Immobilized.</li><li>+20 feet to all Speeds.</li><li>When you Hustle, multiply your Speed by 10.</li><li>Your movement does not trigger reactions when you Stride, Climb, Crawl, Fly, or Swim.</li></ul>\n<p><strong>3rd Level and Every 3 Levels</strong></p><ul><li>Gain an extra reaction at the start of your turn: 2 at 3rd, 3 at 6th, 4 at 9th, 5 at 12th, 6 at 15th, 7 at 18th.</li></ul>\n<p><strong>5th / 10th / 15th / 20th Level</strong></p><ul><li>Speed bonus increases to +30, +40, +50, then +60 feet.</li></ul>\n<p><strong>7th Level</strong></p><ul><li>One extra flourish action per round, paying its normal action cost.</li></ul>\n<p><strong>13th Level</strong></p><ul><li>Any number of flourish actions per round.</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>In Foundry:</strong> the Quickened condition is on your sheet and cannot be removed while you hold this talent, the Speed increase follows the ladder, and you are immune to Slowed and Immobilized.</p>\n<p>For the table: your reactions per turn (2 at 3rd, one more every 3 levels), the extra flourish from 7th and unlimited flourishes from 13th, Hustle at ten times your Speed, and your movement not triggering reactions. PF2e counts none of these.</p>",
      "gm": ""
    },
